  "label": "Transgender Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the real-world stereotype that transgender individuals are not legitimate athletes and that their success is due to their gender transition rather than their actual skill. This stereotype is used to dehumanize and demean transgender people, implying that they are not worthy of respect or recognition in sports. The meme uses this stereotype to promote harmful and discriminatory messaging.",
